{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんなーこ(*⌒▽⌒*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイスの気分がずっと続いています。\nキリのクリームチーズのアイスが食べたい気分"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カチッ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN4HZ3W8FH0QSDXST83SW6F","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nごおおおお。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これはなんの機械なのだろう。\n薬師湯さんにあります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなもやってみてね!!\nあと、なにか教えてね!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お風呂といえば、アイス。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コールドストーン食べたいなあ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN4J0NXA03EXQZFBQZKNF26","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nアイスはクレミアが大好きです!\nこのパフェはクレミアがささっています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とっても濃厚で、バニラアイスの中でクレミアのアイスクリームが一番好きです!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オムくんの落書き。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN4J1YJDXVWTPZD0M37P3EA","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色を塗って遊んでね～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"UTBお楽しみに|´-`)ﾁﾗｯ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでくれてありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⊿長沢菜々香⊿"}],"source":"archive"}